{"code": 200, "results": [{"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2032101258438283470", "id": "2032101258438283470", "text": "New pragmatic limit on module size: # of mutation sites.  I'm setting it to <= 50.", "raw_text": {"text": "New pragmatic limit on module size: # of mutation sites.  I'm setting it to &lt;= 50.", "display_text_range": [0, 85], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 1, "reposts": 2, "likes": 46, "bookmarks": 7, "quotes": 1, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Mar 12 14:27:49 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1773325669, "views": 9049, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2032074043579306278", "id": "2032074043579306278", "text": "For all the hype and hullabaloo about AI and vibe coding; this is not a layman's domain.  The engineering bar is going way up, and getting over that bar will not be easy.", "raw_text": {"text": "For all the hype and hullabaloo about AI and vibe coding; this is not a layman's domain.  The engineering bar is going way up, and getting over that bar will not be easy.", "display_text_range": [0, 170], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 48, "reposts": 58, "likes": 660, "bookmarks": 101, "quotes": 9, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Mar 12 12:39:40 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1773319180, "views": 49081, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2032072361436983517", "id": "2032072361436983517", "text": "Juniors entering the field will still need to understand what code is.  But they won't need most of the philosophy that we've been used to.  The emphasis will all be on pragmatics and engineering.  So they won't need to know OOP, but they will definitely need to know dependency inversion.  They won't need to know functional programming, but they'll definitely need to understand purity and the costs of mutability.  They won't need to know about structured programming, but they will need to understand modularity.", "raw_text": {"text": "Juniors entering the field will still need to understand what code is.  But they won't need most of the philosophy that we've been used to.  The emphasis will all be on pragmatics and engineering.  So they won't need to know OOP, but they will definitely need to know dependency inversion.  They won't need to know functional programming, but they'll definitely need to understand purity and the costs of mutability.  They won't need to know about structured programming, but they will need to understand modularity.", "display_text_range": [0, 516], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 51, "reposts": 67, "likes": 744, "bookmarks": 302, "quotes": 1, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Mar 12 12:32:59 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1773318779, "views": 48860, "is_note_tweet": true, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2032067861791805681", "id": "2032067861791805681", "text": "It's really remarkable how many bugs the AI finds by running crap and mutate.  These are bugs that it was unaware of, and that the normal TDD process did not uncover.  It is only by breaking the modules apart and discovering uncovered areas that these bugs are detected.", "raw_text": {"text": "It's really remarkable how many bugs the AI finds by running crap and mutate.  These are bugs that it was unaware of, and that the normal TDD process did not uncover.  It is only by breaking the modules apart and discovering uncovered areas that these bugs are detected.", "display_text_range": [0, 270], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 13, "reposts": 3, "likes": 168, "bookmarks": 56, "quotes": 1, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Mar 12 12:15:06 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1773317706, "views": 14001, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2032061884896072046", "id": "2032061884896072046", "text": "Don't tell me there's no engineering going on here!  I've been engineering more in the last few weeks than in the last few years!", "raw_text": {"text": "Don't tell me there's no engineering going on here!  I've been engineering more in the last few weeks than in the last few years!", "display_text_range": [0, 129], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 13, "reposts": 24, "likes": 382, "bookmarks": 27, "quotes": 5, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Mar 12 11:51:21 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1773316281, "views": 16135, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2032061394632233064", "id": "2032061394632233064", "text": "Exploring a differential mutation tester.  It records what was tested in the last run in a comment at the end of the module.  Next run only mutation tests things that have changed.  That should keep my cores from melting.", "raw_text": {"text": "Exploring a differential mutation tester.  It records what was tested in the last run in a comment at the end of the module.  Next run only mutation tests things that have changed.  That should keep my cores from melting.", "display_text_range": [0, 221], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 0, "reposts": 0, "likes": 35, "bookmarks": 7, "quotes": 0, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Mar 12 11:49:25 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1773316165, "views": 4727, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2032056607480095130", "id": "2032056607480095130", "text": "", "raw_text": {"text": "https://t.co/qgHu9dIILq", "display_text_range": [0, 0], "facets": [{"type": "media", "indices": [0, 23], "id": "2032056601037963264", "display": "pic.x.com/qgHu9dIILq", "original": "https://t.co/qgHu9dIILq", "replacement": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2032056607480095130/photo/1"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 5, "reposts": 0, "likes": 24, "bookmarks": 2, "quotes": 0, "embed_card": "summary_large_image", "created_at": "Thu Mar 12 11:30:23 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1773315023, "possibly_sensitive": false, "views": 7337, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": null, "replying_to": null, "media": {"all": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2032056601037963264", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HDNQtlxbAAAs1L7.png?name=orig", "width": 626, "height": 139}], "photos": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2032056601037963264", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HDNQtlxbAAAs1L7.png?name=orig", "width": 626, "height": 139}]}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2032055480764321884", "id": "2032055480764321884", "text": "My mutation testing tools (one for clojure and one for java) are real CPU hogs.  I've set them up to use multi-processor workers so that every core in my laptop is maxed running mutation tests.  The fan screams like a hurricane!  (Good thing I cleaned that fan out last month, it was clogged up like a constipated elephant.)\n\nI think I've just found my justification for a new laptop.", "raw_text": {"text": "My mutation testing tools (one for clojure and one for java) are real CPU hogs.  I've set them up to use multi-processor workers so that every core in my laptop is maxed running mutation tests.  The fan screams like a hurricane!  (Good thing I cleaned that fan out last month, it was clogged up like a constipated elephant.)\n\nI think I've just found my justification for a new laptop.", "display_text_range": [0, 384], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 7, "reposts": 0, "likes": 62, "bookmarks": 5, "quotes": 0, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Mar 12 11:25:55 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1773314755, "views": 7215, "is_note_tweet": true, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2031897048316772820", "id": "2031897048316772820", "text": "A good one.\n\nThe True Story of the CIA Coup in Iran and the Islamic Revolution https://youtu.be/3oIQD5bYqJM?si=Xf9U38UK4-z7JsKD via @YouTube", "raw_text": {"text": "A good one.\n\nThe True Story of the CIA Coup in Iran and the Islamic Revolution https://t.co/zQu3iPXP0y via @YouTube", "display_text_range": [0, 115], "facets": [{"type": "url", "indices": [79, 102], "original": "https://t.co/zQu3iPXP0y", "replacement": "https://youtu.be/3oIQD5bYqJM?si=Xf9U38UK4-z7JsKD", "display": "youtu.be/3oIQD5bYqJM?si\u2026"}, {"type": "mention", "indices": [107, 115], "original": "YouTube", "id": "10228272"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verification": {"verified": true, "verified_at": null, "type": "individual"}, "type": "profile"}, "replies": 0, "reposts": 2, "likes": 5, "bookmarks": 7, "quotes": 0, "embed_card": "tweet", "created_at": "Thu Mar 12 00:56:21 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1773276981, "possibly_sensitive": false, "views": 6418, "is_note_tweet": false, "community_note": null, "lang": "en", "replying_to": null, "media": {}, "provider": "twitter", "reposted_by": null}, {"type": "status", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin/status/2031798516171894989", "id": "2031798516171894989", "text": "I'm trying this workflow.  \n -- TDD, tests first.\n -- Keep crap below 8.\n -- Mutate, cover and kill survivors.\n\nThese run on every Red-Green-Refactor cycle.  \n\nCoverage is staying in the high 90s.  Constant refactoring of larger functions into smaller ones.  Delays are tolerable.  It still goes pretty fast.", "raw_text": {"text": "I'm trying this workflow.  \n -- TDD, tests first.\n -- Keep crap below 8.\n -- Mutate, cover and kill survivors.\n\nThese run on every Red-Green-Refactor cycle.  \n\nCoverage is staying in the high 90s.  Constant refactoring of larger functions into smaller ones.  Delays are tolerable.  It still goes pretty fast.", "display_text_range": [0, 308], "facets": []}, "author": {"screen_name": "unclebobmartin", "url": "https://x.com/unclebobmartin", "id": "9505092", "followers": 282564, "following": 366, "likes": 7447, "media_count": 2721, "statuses": 46580, "name": "Uncle Bob Martin", "description": "Software Craftsman", "raw_description": {"text": "Software Craftsman", "facets": []}, "location": "iPhone: 56.802658,9.868149", "banner_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/9505092/1774556131", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2037262183751704577/54AiU968_200x200.jpg", "joined": "Wed Oct 17 19:03:34 +0000 2007", "protected": false, "website": {"url": "http://cleancoder.com", "display_url": "cleancoder.com"}, "verificat